{"ID":"20240515131357-w48866d","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131357-w48866d","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131357-w48866d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142142-vkgjt5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142142-vkgjt5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142142-vkgjt5j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:384,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:384\u0026#125;","title":"085","type":"doc","updated":"20240515172906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142142-vkgjt5j","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 836px;","id":"20240515142142-vkgjt5j","updated":"20240515172906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"40餘歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/08"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甲狀腺腫在長期服藥中，另因PSA值高踞不下懷疑是攝護腺癌。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.胃口：好但不吃太飽。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.口渴：不渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.大便：日一行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.睡眠：每晚睡四、五小時。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.易汗否：難汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.體力：時好時弱，自覺不差。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.手腳：足溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.小便：淡黃色，夜尿一、二次，已有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：洪大， 為夏脈 ，重按則無，並非附骨脈 ，屬正常。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡紅濕舌。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷：手掌皮乾 。髮微白、稍掉頭髮。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 濕熱在下焦，導至發炎，今PSA值高，並非攝護腺癌。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豬苓三錢，滑石六錢，澤瀉六錢，白朮三錢，黃芩三錢，黃柏三錢，烏藥五錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細辛二錢，麥冬三錢，天花粉三錢，側柏葉三錢，當歸二錢，何首烏五錢，海藻三錢，補骨脂三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五帖  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12碗水煮成4碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說： 如無癌之寒熱表徵或附骨脈，即使PSA高至8，亦非攝護腺癌。因濕熱困於下焦不出，致發炎，故以豬苓湯攻小便。又因小便無血，故去阿膠不用。另加黃芩、黃柏清下焦熱。經此攻法，混濁當隨尿而出。又因尿頻，用烏藥、細辛導心火至下焦。手掌乾，故用麥冬、天花粉以潤肺。海藻以處理甲狀腺腫。"}]}]}]}]}